        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back From Earth</strong> tells the story of <i>Blip-Blop</i>, a small, fragile, and lost alien who crash-landed far from home.<br>To return, they must ascend through unknown planets, each with its own soul and its own symbol. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, the player will have to jump, explore, and discover unique mechanics for each planet: from a blinding sandstorm, to a rain of meteors, to slippery surfaces that punish those who lose control.<br>Every challenge is part of <i>Blip-Blop</i>’s emotional journey, a reflection of their pain and rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>soundtrack of each planet</strong> accompanies its soul, amplifying the atmosphere and emotions.<br>Those who explore carefully will discover a <strong>True Ending</strong> and the <strong>Real Lore Fragments</strong>, hidden pieces that reveal the true story behind the journey, the story of its creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back From Earth</strong> is a short, accessible, deeply emotional and <i>autobiographical</i> experience. It is not about winning.<br>It is about taking one more step forward, <strong>until pain becomes something new</strong><i>.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back From Earth</strong> tells the story of <i>Blip-Blop</i>, a small, fragile, and lost alien who crash-landed far from home.<br>To return, they must ascend through unknown planets, each with its own soul and its own symbol. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, the player will have to jump, explore, and discover unique mechanics for each planet: from a blinding sandstorm, to a rain of meteors, to slippery surfaces that punish those who lose control.<br>Every challenge is part of <i>Blip-Blop</i>’s emotional journey, a reflection of their pain and rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>soundtrack of each planet</strong> accompanies its soul, amplifying the atmosphere and emotions.<br>Those who explore carefully will discover a <strong>True Ending</strong> and the <strong>Real Lore Fragments</strong>, hidden pieces that reveal the true story behind the journey, the story of its creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back From Earth</strong> is a short, accessible, deeply emotional and <i>autobiographical</i> experience. It is not about winning.<br>It is about taking one more step forward, <strong>until pain becomes something new</strong><i>.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "This is the story of a fragile alien climbing through strange worlds in search of home. A journey of symbols and emotions, where every step forward carries the weight of healing.",
